The '''Parkour Start/End''' is a block that can be bought from {{NPCSprite|Amelia}} for {{C|1000}}. It is used to set the start/end of a parkour course on a {{Zone|Private Island}}. 2 are bought from {{NPCSprite|Amelia}} at once.

== Usage ==
The '''Parkour Start/End''' is used to start or end a parkour course on a {{Zone|Private Island}}. It gives island points to those who complete it. To make a complete parkour course, the player must purchase at least two '''{{ID|Parkour Start/End}}s''', one to start the parkour , and one to end it. To create checkpoints, the player must use {{Item|Parkour Checkpoint}}s.

